  "_notes": "tmgGlobalCodes is insert-only (NeverDelete=Y). Only FieldName + Code come from the data tab; PartnerID/EffDate are PARAMs, Decode ECHOes Code, the flags are CONSTs -- the engine fills those, so the BA's data tab need only carry FieldName + Code."
